atus":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p023:m0070","start":70,"end":74,"surface":"子弟同姓","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p023:m0097","start":97,"end":100,"surface":"周天子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p023:m0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"諸子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p023:m0159","start":159,"end":161,"surface":"始皇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000533","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030","text":"維秦王兼有天下，立名為皇帝，乃撫東土，至于瑯邪。列侯武城侯王離、列侯通武侯王賁、倫侯建成侯趙亥、倫侯昌武侯成、倫侯武信侯馮毋擇、丞相隗林、丞相王綰、卿李斯、卿王戊、五大夫趙嬰、五大夫楊樛從，與議於海上。曰：「古之帝者，地不過千里，諸侯各守其封域，或朝或否，相侵暴亂，殘伐不止，猶刻金石，以自為紀。古之五帝三王，知教不同，法度不明，假威鬼神，以欺遠方，實不稱名，故不久長。其身未歿，諸侯倍叛，法令不行。今皇帝并一海內，以為郡縣，天下和平。昭明宗廟，體道行德，尊號大成。群臣相與誦皇帝功德，刻于金石，以為表經。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000533","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0024","start":24,"end":31,"surface":"列侯武城侯王離","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000575","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0032","start":32,"end":39,"surface":"列侯通武侯王賁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000567","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0040","start":40,"end":47,"surface":"倫侯建成侯趙亥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000576","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0048","start":48,"end":54,"surface":"倫侯昌武侯成","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000577","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0055","start":55,"end":63,"surface":"倫侯武信侯馮毋擇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000578","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0064","start":64,"end":68,"surface":"丞相隗林","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000579","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0069","start":69,"end":73,"surface":"丞相王綰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000573","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0074","start":74,"end":77,"surface":"卿李斯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000537","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0078","start":78,"end":81,"surface":"卿王戊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000580","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0082","start":82,"end":87,"surface":"五大夫趙嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000581","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0088","start":88,"end":93,"surface":"五大夫楊樛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000582","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0150","start":150,"end":154,"surface":"五帝三王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0201","start":201,"end":203,"surface":"皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000533","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p030:m0238","start":238,"end":240,"surface":"皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000533","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-006","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang","source":{"title":"史記／卷006","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷006","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷006&oldid=7907969","revisi